@startuml
!include pek-style.puml

title Perception Experience Kit Container Component Overview

top to bottom direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ranksep 80
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam linetype ortho

component "External application /\nservice" as External
interface "FrameResults packet" as IPerception

rectangle "Perception Experience Kit Container" {
  package "Perception Experience Kit element chain" as CHAIN {
    component "pekinfer" as PEKINFER
    component "pektracker" as PEKTRACKER
    component "pekperformance" as PEKPERF
    component "pekosd" as PEKOSD
    component "peksink" as PEKSINK
  }

  package "Inference execution inside pekinfer" as INFERBOX {
    component "OpChain / Op system\n(JSON descriptors,\nconfigure -> bind -> process,\nloopId-based execution)" as OPC
    component "Preprocess Ops" as PRE
    component "Inference Ops\n(ONNX / Hailo / ExecuTorch)" as INF
    component "Postprocess Parsers" as POST
  }

  package "Stable runtime contract" as CONTRACT {
    component "FrameResultsMeta /\nFrameResults" as PERC
    component "Generated packet serializer /\npublisher boundary" as PERCSER
  }

  package "Current pipeline host layer" as HOST {
    component "GStreamer runtime\n(current media transport,\nscheduling, and metadata carrier)" as GST
  }
}

PEKINFER -down-> PEKTRACKER
PEKTRACKER -down-> PEKPERF
PEKPERF -down-> PEKOSD
PEKOSD -down-> PEKSINK

OPC -down-> PRE
PRE -down-> INF
INF -down-> POST
OPC ..> PEKINFER : executes inside

CHAIN --> PERC

PERC -down-> PERCSER
PERCSER -down-> IPerception
IPerception -down-> External

GST -up-> CHAIN

INFERBOX -[hidden]right-> CHAIN
CHAIN -[hidden]right-> CONTRACT
CHAIN -[hidden]down-> HOST
INFERBOX -[hidden]down-> HOST
CONTRACT -[hidden]down-> HOST
CONTRACT -[hidden]down-> IPerception
IPerception -[hidden]down-> External

legend bottom
- GStreamer is the current pipeline/orchestration host layer.
  It handles media transport, scheduling, and metadata carriage.
- OpChain is the inference-specific glue inside pekinfer.
  It binds preprocess, backend execution, and postprocess stages.
- FrameResults is the generated runtime contract passed between Perception Experience Kit components
  and published to external applications.
- pekinfer creates and enriches that contract via OpChain execution.
- pektracker and pekperformance append more structured runtime data.
- pekosd and peksink consume it for rendering and publication.
endlegend

@enduml
